      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a \"phase\" though. it feels permanent. like the well is just dry. i look at everything i've done and it feels like i was just performing, and now the performance is over and there's nothing actually underneath. it's like i've fulfilled my purpose and now i'm just... lingering. does that make sense? like, why keep going when the only thing that made me 'me' is gone?\n Balance the the tone between and a philosophical query to",
